    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 2617,
    "lineEnd": 2620
  },
  "section": "3.58",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Cleric Traits table: Hit Point Die and training with Light and Medium armor and Shields.  \n- Gain the Cleric's level 1 features, which are listed in the Cleric Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
